      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the deep despair in your words, and I want to validate that the feeling of everything being a performance or \"fixing\" something is a very painful way to experience life. It is not your fault, and nothing you have \"done\" or \"not done\" is worth the hope.\n\nPlease know that I cannot fix this or take this weight, but you deserve to be with someone who can actually hold that pain without you feeling the need to perform.",
